+## Scoped negative-zero saved values
+
+MV-S6-MOVEMENT-011 and MV-S6-MOVEMENT-012 follow the accepted design13 boundary:
+its explicit negative-zero rejection for the two faceIndex and four direct-coordinate
+families does not extend to relative movement or other JSON numbers. The movement
